/div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暮れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">日暮；黄昏；傍晚；终了；结束；年终；岁末</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92019\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどうして<ruby>良<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いか<ruby>途方<rp>(</rp><rt>とほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>暮<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她很想知道如何生活。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">くれぐれも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">诚恳地；衷心地；全心全意地；反复地；一再；再三</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225438\">くれぐれもお<ruby>体<rp>(</rp><rt>からだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をお<ruby>大事<rp>(</rp><rt>だいじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你也要照顾你的身体。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">くれる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">给（我或我方）；让（我方）得到；给（带轻蔑，常作「くれてやる」）；为我（方）做……；费心做；对（某人）不利地做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79331\"><ruby>友達<rp>(</rp><rt>ともだち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がはがきをくれるように<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>頼<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我的朋友请求我给