ja\">黒字</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くろじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">盈余；顺差；（账面）黑字；黑字；黑色的字</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172454\"><ruby>今月<rp>(</rp><rt>こんげつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>黒字<rp>(</rp><rt>くろじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个月是黑色。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">加える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くわえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">添加；加上；附加；并入；增加；加快；提升；包括；计入；吸收；接纳；造成（损害）；给予；施加</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143709\"><ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>加<rp>(</rp><rt>くわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてペースト<ruby>状<rp>(</rp><rt>じょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になるまでかき<ruby>回<rp>(</rp><rt>まわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">加入水,直到它变成粉末。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">咥える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くわえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">咬住；衔住；含在嘴里；带着；携带；随身带</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111317\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はパイプをくわえて<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他用管道说话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">詳しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\