v><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怨言；牢骚；抱怨；痴；无明</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"109889\"><ruby>一日中<rp>(</rp><rt>いちにちじゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>愚痴<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をこぼしてばかりいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我一整天都在抱怨。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ぐっすり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">酣睡；熟睡</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"169667\"><ruby>昨夜<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうべ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はぐっすり<ruby>眠<rp>(</rp><rt>ねむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">昨天晚上没睡得好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ぐっと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">突然地；一下子；一口气；猛地；咕嘟地；相当地；非常；很多；大大地；牢固地；用力地；紧紧地；施加压力地；完全地；彻底地；深深地；深切地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199901\">トムは<ruby>自分<rp>(</rp><rt>じぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>感情<rp>(</rp><rt>かんじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をぐっと<ruby>抑<rp>(</rp><rt>おさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">汤姆放弃了自己的情绪。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ぐらい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span c